      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for pointing me to 94663. I have posted a detailed comparison in the top-level response.\n\nI agree that the basic GET_CERTIFICATE and GET_CHALLENGE invocation overlaps. However, 94632 and 94633 add connection serialization, persistent requester state, and successful VCA reuse, which are not currently present in 94663.\n\nBefore rewriting the stack, could you please confirm the preferred dependency order: should I rebuild these unique changes as follow-ups to 94663, or should 94663 be rebased on 94632 and 94633?",
